          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liOMWAMI nilinzitsila, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana womundu, oluchelo olwa muli ninalwo shiaIsiraeli luli lurie, olusunga mbu Tsindaalo tsimeetekha, ne buli libisulo lifuba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho obaboolele ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboolambu Ndalaakamia oluchelo olwo, kata shibalalwikhoonyelanga lube oluchelo muIsiraeli khandi ta; nebutswa obaboolele mbu Tsindaalo tsili ahambi, nobuusibwi bwabuli libisulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba shililabaho libisulo liosi likhaya kata obufumu obulombelesia munzu yaIsiraeli khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba isie nisie OMWAMI; ndalaboola ne likhuwa elia ndalaboola lilakholekha; shililashisibwa khandi ta; okhuba mundaalo tsieenywe, inywe abeinzu yeinduli, ndalaboola likhuwa nindikhola, Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
