          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana womundu, lola, abeinzu yaIsiraeli baboola mbu Libisulo elia alola nelietsindaalo etsili okhwitsa olunyuma; arumbulanga akebise ebishili ehale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
